{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/d914553df7953c3a51739557334e5339.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to become the savior of the great Quntique dynasty?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quntique Dynasty is a &quot;Rogue Lite&quot; game that combines &quot;Tower Defense&quot; and &quot;Hack and Slash&quot; genres.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/13d62dfe5fa5098003908a3c2a1c8ac3.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/d6c2efb88a78279a8fdb2d28fe68447e.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find new equipment, upgrade it, and dominate the dynasty map. The king will surely reward you for your efforts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/5b003b981bea56bc7615bf0e02d808ab.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/04fe59125b65eec80adfd6720fbe2757.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/3f973e486b5ed7bb3ec06b2a00dbddee.poster.avif?t=1755005535\" width=428 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/3f973e486b5ed7bb3ec06b2a00dbddee.webm?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/3f973e486b5ed7bb3ec06b2a00dbddee.mp4?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While conquering the map, don't forget to clear the dungeons. Dungeons are as bountiful as they are dangerous; if you believe you can succeed, don't hesitate.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8378fda9c5bc67fcce0cd7656d9dd4ac.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/6774848a833babfdd72dff43c1af83c6.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/b4259b1973e3d08c85551a9d8afd587f.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, to clear the entire map, you must complete all 3 levels of each region.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/247f5cb825f3f71d3bdea80f0c75cdf2.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=516 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/3e2b11307df7611fbe2254b19be757f8.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every weapon type you use has its unique skills. As long as you time your moves correctly, every weapon is powerful.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/15ba060d40b95c2de27a1f336edfab3b.poster.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1348 height=758 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/15ba060d40b95c2de27a1f336edfab3b.webm?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/15ba060d40b95c2de27a1f336edfab3b.mp4?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to use your &quot;Dash&quot; skill to vary your movement and evade enemies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8383f33843e4597b71cf359f03d1ece2.poster.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1040 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8383f33843e4597b71cf359f03d1ece2.webm?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/8383f33843e4597b71cf359f03d1ece2.mp4?t=1755005535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will level up as you fight. When you level up, you can gain permanent abilities that will support you in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/d392a573b9f12dd454a4c81e89754267.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PASSIVE SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before entering battle, you can improve your passive abilities with the experience points you have earned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/a7a1ea5c8f5b79e3a18abc745323ee53.avif?t=1755005535\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3887660?t=1755005535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/99887be12aef958dc75780a852e3c6713511e670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755005535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/b786fd1003a55ad6ada12bd8663b236c394171e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755005535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/b786fd1003a55ad6ada12bd8663b236c394171e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755005535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887660/extras/d914553df7953c3a51739557334e5339.avif?t=1755005535\" width=1600 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to become the savior of the great Quntique dynasty?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quntique Dynasty is a &quot;Rogue Lite&quot; game that combines